{"author": "raymond91125", "body": "Dear all, \n\nThe proposal has been made to obsolete GO:0009972 cytidine deamination\nsee https://github.com/geneontology/go-ontology/issues/29724\nSingle-step BP, consider GO:0004126 cytidine deaminase activity.\n\nExperimental annotations that need to be reviewed are here: \nhttps://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/19nAnkTVGwMKjKfkI3jKpPo3t6bMrwCyJzUzJJt6ul10/edit?gid=0#gid=0\n\nImpacted groups: \n~EcoCyc 1~\n~MTBBASE 1~\nRGD 1\n~TAIR 1~\n~UniProt 6~\n\n** Group contacts: https://github.com/geneontology/go-site/blob/master/metadata/group-contacts.csv\n----\n\nMappings that need to be reviewed: (InterPro2GO, UniProt-Keywords, UniRule) \nterm\tfile\tline\nGO:0009972\tinterpro2go\tInterPro:IPR006262 Cytidine deaminase, homotetrameric > GO:cytidine deamination ; GO:0009972\nGO:0009972\tinterpro2go\tInterPro:IPR006263 Cytidine deaminase, homodimeric > GO:cytidine deamination ; GO:0009972\nGO:0009972\tinterpro2go\tInterPro:IPR013171 Cytidine/deoxycytidylate deaminase, zinc-binding domain > GO:cytidine deamination ; GO:0009972\nGO:0009972\tinterpro2go\tInterPro:IPR020797 Cytidine deaminase, bacteria > GO:cytidine deamination ; GO:0009972\nGO:0009972\tunirule2go\tUniRule:UR001376779 > GO:cytidine deamination ; GO:0009972\n\n\n\nThanks.\n", "created_at": "2025-04-01T16:57:46Z", "key": "issue", "labels": ["annotation review", "direct_ann_to_list_of_terms"], "state": "closed", "state_reason": "completed", "title": "Review annotations to GO:0009972 cytidine deamination", "type": "issue", "updated_at": "2025-11-03T16:52:15Z"}
